ion into Parser","messageBody":"Move command recognition, task-number validation, date and time parsing, and task construction out of Bob. Return a parsed command containing only the action and required data so Bob can focus on execution, persistence, and user feedback without changing existing console behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":187,"deletions":103}}},{"hash":"cbda57f20ae0fb94e2e5f3de83da5599641833e7","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Make Bob own application state as an object","messageBody":"Replace static UI and storage globals with instance fields, add a file-path constructor and run method, and keep main limited to application startup. Let helper methods use the owned TaskList, Storage, and Ui directly while preserving the existing welcome-before-load output order.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":55,"deletions":31}}},{"hash":"923a0102ebd7dc11f47926fd9dfa3f3f315ca52b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027A-MoreOOP\u0027 Merge branch \u0027A-MoreOOP\u0027","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"04fd2f24a011c11d86c17960cf9070b1363312cb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Introduce a type-safe command hierarchy","messageBody":"Replace Parser\u0027s enum-based ParsedCommand, nullable task field, and sentinel task index with concrete Command subclasses for add, list, mark, unmark, delete, and exit requests. Keep execution in Bob for this focused intermediate step while using polymorphic isExit behavior to establish the stretch-goal command abstraction without changing user-visible behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":143,"deletions":74}}},{"hash":"11d2c33d3e45774e6b5c66fdc924d3c27f4fe22d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move command execution into command subclasses","messageBody":"Add a common execute contract to Command and let each concrete command own its task-list operation, persistence, rollback, and UI feedback. Replace 